{=2}Lord Hyou army

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:35.350
{=2}Lord Hyou army

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:35.390
{=2}Lord Hyou army

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:41.860
This put them at the back of Lord Hyou's army,
snaking its way to Sho's right.

